        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dominic Cooper, Christopher Markus, Stephen McFeely, Lara Pulver, Ian Fleming, Howard Stark, Ann O'Neill\n- TV Series and Films: Agent Carter, Captain America: The First Avenger, Marvel Cinematic Universe, Fleming: The Man Who Would Be Bond, Marvel One-Shot\n- Organizations: ABC\n\nFacts:\n- Dominic Cooper portrayed the young Howard Stark in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, including Agent Carter.\n- Agent Carter is an American television series created for ABC by Christopher Markus and Stephen McFeely.\n- Agent Carter was inspired by the 2011 film Captain America: The First Avenger and the 2013 Marvel One-Shot short film of the same name.\n- In Fleming: The Man Who Would Be Bond, Dominic Cooper stars as Fleming.\n- In Fleming: The Man Who Would Be Bond, Lara Pulver plays Fleming's love interest, Ann O'Neill.",
